Instructions:
Controls for smartphones:
• Hold your finger to make the Wave fly up;
• Don't press anything to make the Wave fly down.

Controls for computers:
• Hold the left mouse button/space to make the Wave fly up;
• Don't press anything to make the Wave fly down;
• Q - add a checkpoint in practice mode;
• E - delete the last checkpoint in practice mode;
• ESC / P / TAB - pause.

Desktop controls:
─ Arrows (←) (→) left and right or "A" and "D" ─ ball movement;
─ "R" button ─ restart;
─ "ESC" button ─ toggle pause;
─ "LEFT MOUSE BUTTON" ─ control buttons in the menu.

Mobile controls:
─ Tap the right and left half of the screen to move the ball;
─ Tap the buttons in the menu to press them.

• Tap the emoji that matches the word shown on the screen;
• Each round gets faster, so react quickly before time runs out;
• Build streaks to earn more points and reach higher scores;
• Be careful — one mistake and it's game over;
• Choose your favorite theme and see how far you can go!

WASD / Arrows - movement;
Space - Brake;
E - Throw a squirrel;
Shift - Acceleration;
Z - Roar;
X - Healing;
C - Acceleration of squirrels.
